  "description": "Watch now | Supreme Court decisions, geopolitical risk and portfolio allocation strategy",
  "body_html": "<p>Before I briefly touch on a handful of significant market developments…</p><p><strong>If you are new here, be sure to check out the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Playbook</a>. </strong>There are a plethora of resources, built over the last few years, linked in this document, including:</p><ul><li><p>The daily stock screener, that has repeatedly produced big winning stocks. This is a python screener that ranks 5000+ stocks and analyzes heavy volume breakouts from consolidations. More than 95% of my own stock picks originate from this.</p></li><li><p>My personal positions, updated regularly. </p></li><li><p>Link to the Main Chat area, where you can ask me anything you want, during market hours. We have several other investors that have gotten very good at stock selections, including <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Matt's OnlyStocks&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:229828079,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7f81ff96-44f6-403e-914e-9926a4d41ec8_896x1152.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2a639c6c-311c-427a-ba04-73d2ac8605d8&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> who is a newer creator, but has consistently identified high performance stocks. We openly share information here…no gatekeeping. We are a small, tight knit group that just love the markets.</p></li><li><p>Several tools, including position risk calculator and pine script signals I personally built that you can add to your TradingView charts. “Timothy’s Trend Indicator” is a favorite for many and has been publicly tested/used by for over 3 years now, successfully. </p></li></ul><p>Help yourself! </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>This is the “Weekly Wrap Up” where I share posts this week you may have missed. I am fully cognizant you have a life and a post may have snuck by you. </p><h4><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-216462441?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">The Bull Market Is Not Over + Iran</a></strong></h4><p>Michael Burry has been shorting the market for years. To no surprise, he has also returned -40% over the last 3 years and is on track to lose this year as well. Why he is one of the top Substacks…I will never understand. This is a clear demonstration of NOT listening to price action. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/leaders-forming-under-the-surface\">In this article</a></strong> I show how there are not technical indications of a bear market…even though the last ~3 weeks has been nothing but market chop…dicing up retail investors. The VIX, Russell 2000 and stocks making 52-week highs, are all still showing positive signs. I also discuss sectors showing the most strength, along with 3 tickers that have had recent breakouts ready for a buy. </p><h4><strong>Gold &amp; Silver - Another Leg Building</strong></h4><p>We sold our silver miner position on the 29th of January, locking in a +30.6% gain…the day before silver plummeted more than -30% (literally dodged a silver bullet!). We only caught a piece of the trend (I am not a “bottom buyer”)…but after a ~+116% run, a -30% pullback is nothing. Just a wild ride. That said, accumulations are picking up again. That does not mean the local bottom is in, but right now I am awaiting a clear break out from the down trend. A clear breakout is a essentially a large green candle, with volume. I have the silver miner down below I am monitoring, and will provide a signal for, for a re-entry. </p><h4><strong>Supreme Court Decisions on Trump’s Tariffs</strong></h4><p>In October, the stock market took a nose dive. It was a quiet two months. My speculation that the real reason the market plummeted was that it was pricing in a tariff decision in advance. Recall, the stock market is a forward looking, discounting mechanism. This was the exact same time that betting platforms like Polymarket and Kalshi started predicting odds for the court ruling in Trump’s favor, or not. This signals to me that the decision, whatever it is, has largely been priced into the markets. Yes, we may see some intraday volatility from short term traders, but the larger macro moves have been accounted for. </p><p><strong>Update:</strong> Supreme Court did not rule in favor of Trump’s tariffs, per IBD. Narrative remains the same, this was priced in. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png\" width=\"938\" height=\"481\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:481,&quot;width&quot;:938,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:61817,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/188613324?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dvfw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ec024e-ae19-41cb-bcde-dab48377c633_938x481.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Betting markets started placing wagers on Supreme Courts possible decision on Trump’s tariffs, right before the market took a dump. </figcaption></figure></div><h4><strong>The StockTok ETF continues to crush the S&amp;P 500</strong></h4><p>The results of the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a>, a basket of 10 stocks, is updated regularly in the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a>. It hit a new today, with a +9% gain, while the S&amp;P 500 futures continued to stall at -.36%. After  5 weeks, I get the question often: “Are these still a buy?” <strong>Yes</strong>. This ETF was designed for 2026. I would only say no if all of them had miraculously pumped more than say +30% and/or we were later in the year. This is the lazy portfolio for those that like to invest more long term with busy schedules.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!C5Mp!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d313d26-4290-4cc1-b819-9fae214f08bc_868x811.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!C5Mp!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d313d26-4290-4cc1-b819-9fae214f08bc_868x811.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!C5Mp!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d313d26-4290-4cc1-b819-9fae214f08bc_868x811.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!C5Mp!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d313d26-4290-4cc1-b819-9fae214f08bc_868x811.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!C5Mp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d313