jstocks.substack.com/p/gold-and-silver-are-not-done?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p>That is most of the highlights for the week. Again, if you have questions, ping me in the main chat, linked in the playbook above. Have a great weekend and be sure to take time off…its so important to come to the markets fresh on Monday, with a good attitude. </p><p><strong>Please like ❤️ and re-stack this post. The 1/2 second it takes you to press those buttons, helps us fight through the AI slop on Substack. </strong></p><h4><strong>Finally, the game plan for the silver miner stock… ⬇️</strong></h4>",
